{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Archimedean.noble_gas_characterization","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Archimedean.noble_gas_characterization","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Nat.Notation"],"declarations":9,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.noble_gas_characterization","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.noble_gas_characterization","kind":"theorem","line":52,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/noble_gas_characterization.lean#L52-L62","doc":"**Noble gas ⟺ full-of-curls** ([`prop:noble-gas-characterization`]).\n\nFor a stable atom `𝓐(Z, N)`, chemical inertness (noble-gas status)\ncoincides exactly with the topological full-of-curls decomposition\nof its electron cloud.  Both directions of the iff are recorded\nas a single statement; concretising either side to explicit\nHopf-link enumeration is downstream work. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:noble-gas-characterization","label":"prop:noble-gas-characterization","md":"quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/noble-gas-characterization.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.AtomLike.claim_noble_iff_curls","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.AtomLike.claim_noble_iff_curls","kind":"theorem","line":50,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/noble_gas_characterization.lean#L50-L50","doc":"Manuscript characterisation: for stable atoms, noble-gas status\ncoincides with the full-of-curls topological decomposition. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.AtomLike.IsNobleGas","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.AtomLike.IsNobleGas","kind":"def","line":47,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/noble_gas_characterization.lean#L47-L47","doc":"Physical noble-gas predicate: chemically inert. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.AtomLike.IsFullOfCurls","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.AtomLike.IsFullOfCurls","kind":"def","line":45,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/noble_gas_characterization.lean#L45-L45","doc":"Topological noble-gas predicate: the electron cloud decomposes\nas a disjoint union of closed sub-Hopf links with monotone\nnesting (`p · T_{2,3} = S_1 ⊔ … ⊔ S_k`, each\n`S_i = 2 n_i² · T_{2,3}`, with `n_1 < … < n_k`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.AtomLike.stable","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.AtomLike.stable","kind":"def","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/noble_gas_characterization.lean#L40-L40","doc":"Stability witness: only stable nuclei are admitted. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.AtomLike.N","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.AtomLike.N","kind":"def","line":38,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/noble_gas_characterization.lean#L38-L38","doc":"Neutron number. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.AtomLike.Z","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.AtomLike.Z","kind":"def","line":36,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/noble_gas_characterization.lean#L36-L36","doc":"Proton number. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.AtomLike.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.AtomLike.mk","kind":"ctor","line":34,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/noble_gas_characterization.lean#L34-L34","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.AtomLike","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.AtomLike","kind":"class","line":31,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/noble_gas_characterization.lean#L31-L50","doc":"Abstract atom record: a stable nucleus (`def:stable-nucleus`) with\nproton/neutron counts and the topological data of its electron\ncloud `p · T_{2,3}`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}